{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a55a91fd-076f-8a70-87e6-5627e8054f89",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T12:44:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. This is Hector Morales. I have a question about brush pickup. We had that storm and there are branches and yard waste all over my yard. When is the brush pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, brush and yard waste, got it. Let me pull up the schedule here. Are you looking for the next scheduled pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And how does it need to be bundled? I want to do it right the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Give me one second, I'm just typing this in. Bear with me, the system's a little slow today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I'm on a laptop myself, the corner is cracked, so I understand slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, brush goes out in bundles, tied with twine, not wire, and kept to a manageable length so the crew can lift it. Keep it at the curb, not in the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not wire, twine. And what length? You said manageable. That's not a number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:44:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair point. Around four feet is what I'd tell people, and keep each bundle light enough for one person to carry. Loose leaves and small stuff go in paper yard waste bags, not plastic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:44:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paper bags, not plastic. Four feet, twine. And the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:44:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm noting your pickup falls on your regular collection day, so put it out the night before. If you tell me your street I can double check, otherwise the city website has the calendar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:44:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll check the calendar on the website. That's enough for me. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:44:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Morales. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T12:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
